{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.MotivicMassMeasure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.MotivicMassMeasure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.divisorWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.divisorWeight","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Codimension/weight d_i of each exceptional divisor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.divisorClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.divisorClass","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The class [E_i°] of the smooth open part of each exceptional divisor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.numDivisors","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.numDivisors","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Number of exceptional divisors produced by the reduction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.totalMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.totalMass","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L34-L34","doc":"The measure of the whole arc space (= total motivic mass). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.K0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.K0","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Ambient Grothendieck ring (target of the measure). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.MotivicMassMeasure","kind":"structure","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L24-L40","doc":"The **motivic mass measure** μ on the arc space L(X).\n\nMeasures cylindrical subsets of L(X) and returns a class in the\ndimension-completion M̂ of K_0(Var)[L^{-1}]. The total measure\nequals the sum ∑ [E_i°] L^{-d_i} over exceptional divisors of the\nGröbner-Shirshov reduction (Kontsevich change-of-variables). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:motivic-mass-measure","label":"def:motivic-mass-measure","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.classOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.classOf","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L22-L22","doc":"Class map [·] : Var → Ring sending a variety to its motive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.lefschetz","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.lefschetz","kind":"def","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L20-L20","doc":"The Lefschetz motive L = [A^1] in the ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.Ring","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.Ring","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L18-L18","doc":"Underlying ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties.mk","kind":"ctor","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L16-L16","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsKnots.GrothendieckRingOfVarieties","kind":"structure","line":12,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/motivic-mass-measure.lean#L12-L22","doc":"Abstract Grothendieck ring of varieties K_0(Var_k).\n\nCarries the Lefschetz motive L = [A^1] and admits the\nlocalization M = K_0(Var)[L^{-1}] used by motivic integration. ","signatureChunk":0}]}